WEBVTT

01:40.729 --> 01:44.250
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.100 --> 01:47.160
[Episod 3]

01:47.670 --> 01:48.479
Bagus.

01:51.150 --> 01:52.910
Munafik, paranoid,

01:53.070 --> 01:55.710
